#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:1
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_ShowOldSeaMap"
msgid ""
"The ferry to SLATEPORT is…\p"
"I beg your pardon?\n"
"Can we sail to this place on the map?\p"
"I know someone who will help you better.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"开往凯那市的渡轮是……\p"
"您说什么？\n"
"能不能开到地图上的这个地方？\p"
"我认识一个更能帮上您的人。\n"
"请稍等。$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:8
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_ThatPass"
msgid ""
"The ferry to SLATEPORT is…\p"
"Oh?\n"
"That PASS…$"
msgstr ""
"开往凯那市的渡轮是……\p"
"哦？\n"
"那张船票……$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:13
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_ShowEonTicket"
msgid ""
"Aye, mate, are you the one who brought\n"
"that mighty odd PASS?\p"
"I'll tell you, you're trying to reach a\n"
"tiny spit of an island far in the south.\p"
"There's no telling what we'll encounter\n"
"once we reach there, aye.\l"
"That shivers my timbers!\p"
"All aboard!$"
msgstr ""
"喂，伙计，那张奇怪的船票\n"
"就是你带来的吗？\p"
"我跟你说，你要去的是\n"
"遥远南方的一座小小的岛屿。\p"
"到了那里会遇到什么，\n"
"谁也说不准啊。\l"
"真让我浑身发抖！\p"
"全体登船！$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:23
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_SouthernIslandSailBack"
msgid ""
"Aye, mate, there's nothing here to\n"
"see or do on this forgettable island.\p"
"What say we sail back to LILYCOVE?$"
msgstr ""
"喂，伙计，在这座不起眼的岛上\n"
"没什么可看也没什么可做的。\p"
"我们开回水静市怎么样？$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:28
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_SailHome"
msgid ""
"Aye, right, then!\n"
"Sail home we will!$"
msgstr ""
"好嘞，那就这样！\n"
"我们开船回家！$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:32
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_AsYouLike"
msgid "Aye, right, as you like, then.$"
msgstr "好嘞，随你的便吧。$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:35
msgctxt "SouthernIsland_Interior_Text_Sign"
msgid ""
"“All dreams are but another reality.\n"
"Never forget…”$"
msgstr ""
"“所有的梦都是另一种现实。\n"
"永远不要忘记……”$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_1.inc:39
msgctxt "SouthernIsland_Exterior_Text_Sign"
msgid ""
"“Those whose memories fade seek to\n"
"carve them in their hearts…”$"
msgstr ""
"“记忆逐渐淡去的人们，\n"
"想要将它们铭刻在心中……”$"
